## 1. Analysis & Pre-Thinking

- **Core Requirements:**
  1. `<RouterView>` stays the single rendering path (no swapping it for the wall in `App.vue`).
  2. On **mobile**, `/` (root) and the project root (`home`) must land on the **Activity Wall**.
